{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/LOGO_SITE_CLAMO_1_2.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to <strong>monitor live surveillance feeds for a mysterious organization</strong>, keeping a <strong>close eye on the rooms for any anomalies.</strong> Whether it\u2019s furniture moving on its own or something more <strong>sinister</strong>, you\u2019ll need to <strong>report each anomaly by clicking on it and selecting its type or choosing the correct location and description from a menu.</strong> With anomalies appearing at random, every moment is unpredictable. <strong>Let too many go unnoticed, and the consequences could be deadly.</strong> Your objective is simple: <strong>survive the night shift from midnight to 6 AM.</strong> Stay alert, rely on your memory, and keep your focus, this job isn\u2019t for the faint of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/CLAMO_GIF1.gif?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/CLAMO_GIF2.gif?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/Features.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHOTOREALISTIC GRAPHICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in stunning, lifelike visuals that make every detail of the surveillance footage feel real.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NORMAL &amp; DARK MODE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between lighting modes to suit your preference or enhance visibility during gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">30+ ANOMALIES PER LEVEL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a wide variety of unpredictable anomalies, each with unique behaviors and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELL CRAFTED SOUND DESIGN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric audio cues and immersive sound effects heighten the suspense and keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOM ANOMALY PATTERN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two playthroughs are the same, ensuring a fresh and unpredictable experience every time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE CCTV ROOMS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor different locations simultaneously, testing your multitasking skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTERACTIVE REPORTING SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">File anomaly reports by selecting the correct type and location from a detailed menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you going to complete your mission? You'll find out in CLAMO.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503220?t=1740688648","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740688648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/0815fd2f4071314a05da7dd86aca7587e5b65286/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740688648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/0815fd2f4071314a05da7dd86aca7587e5b65286/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740688648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains: flashing lights, loud noises, jumpscares, and nudity."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/QR-Discord.png?t=1740688648\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/LOGO_SITE_CLAMO_1_2.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to <strong>monitor live surveillance feeds for a mysterious organization</strong>, keeping a <strong>close eye on the rooms for any anomalies.</strong> Whether it\u2019s furniture moving on its own or something more <strong>sinister</strong>, you\u2019ll need to <strong>report each anomaly by clicking on it and selecting its type or choosing the correct location and description from a menu.</strong> With anomalies appearing at random, every moment is unpredictable. <strong>Let too many go unnoticed, and the consequences could be deadly.</strong> Your objective is simple: <strong>survive the night shift from midnight to 6 AM.</strong> Stay alert, rely on your memory, and keep your focus, this job isn\u2019t for the faint of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/CLAMO_GIF1.gif?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/CLAMO_GIF2.gif?t=1740688648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/extras/Features.png?t=1740688648\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHOTOREALISTIC GRAPHICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in stunning, lifelike visuals that make every detail of the surveillance footage feel real.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NORMAL &amp; DARK MODE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between lighting modes to suit your preference or enhance visibility during gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">30+ ANOMALIES PER LEVEL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter a wide variety of unpredictable anomalies, each with unique behaviors and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WELL CRAFTED SOUND DESIGN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric audio cues and immersive sound effects heighten the suspense and keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOM ANOMALY PATTERN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two playthroughs are the same, ensuring a fresh and unpredictable experience every time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE CCTV ROOMS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor different locations simultaneously, testing your multitasking skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTERACTIVE REPORTING SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">File anomaly reports by selecting the correct type and location from a detailed menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you going to complete your mission? You'll find out in CLAMO.</p>","developers":["Scream Vault"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"descri