t=1740688648","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/ss_1b63754d4084360d0e883dddc3fa340330bf9bed.600x338.jpg?t=1740688648"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/ss_e8a3c5095f21e6c2962abab8acb32b24dc644228.1920x1080.jpg?t=1740688648","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503220/ss_e8a3c5095f21e6c2962abab8acb32b24dc644228.600x338.jpg?t=1740688648"}],"short_description":"CLAMO is a brief horror game where you monitor live surveillance feeds, identifying anomalies like moving furniture or supernatural entities. Spotting an anomaly requires filing a report detailing its type and location. With observation and memory, you must survive, and uncover hidden secrets.","steam_appid":3503220,"support_info":{"email":"screamvault@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://discord.gg/yxwR7xp7m7"}